Google Scholar ] 17. Syed EU, Siddiqi MN, Dogar I, Hamrani MM, Yousafzai AW et al. (2008) Attitudes of pakistani medical students towards psychiatry as a prospective career: a survey. Acad Psychiatry 32: 160-164. doi: 10.1176/appi.ap.32.2.160 . PubMed: 18349339 . [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 18. Kahn E, Redlich FC, Keller M (1945) Attitudes of Medical Students Toward Psychiatry. Yale J Biol Med 17: 611-634. PubMed: 21434232 . [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Hu D, Sun Z, Li H (2012) An overview of medical informatics education in China. Int J Med Inform: S1386-S5056. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 20. Wan X (2013) Challenges for clinical medical education in China. Evid Based Med 6: 19-20. doi: 10.1111/jebm.12023 . PubMed: 23557524 . [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 21. Galka SW, Perkins DV, Butler N, Griffith DA, Schmetzer AD et al. (2005) Medical students’ attitudes toward mental disorders before and after a psychiatric rotation. Acad Psychiatry 29: 357-361. doi: 10.1176/appi.ap.29.4.357 . PubMed: 16223898 . [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 22. Parkhouse J, Ellin DJ (1988) Reasons for doctors’ career choice and change of choice. Br Med J (Clin Res Ed) 296: 1651-1653. doi: 10.1136/bmj.296.6637.1651 . PubMed: 3135059 . [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 23. Zhou S, Leung SA, Li X (2012) The meaning of work among Chinese university students: findings from prototype research methodology. J Couns Psychol 59: 408-423. doi: 10.1037/a0028374 . PubMed: 22774866 . [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 24. Wang C, Rao K, Wu S, Liu Q (2013) Health care in China: improvement, challenges, and reform. Chest 143: 524-531. doi: 10.1378/chest.12-1839 . PubMed: 23381317 . [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 25. Liu Y, Rao K, Wu J, Gakidou E (2008) China’s health system performance. Lancet 372: 1914–23. PubMed: 18930536 . [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 26. Cao Q, Shi L, Wang H, Dong K (2012) Report from 