ski A, Khazaal Y. Supported decision making for people with mental health disorders in clinical practice: a&nbsp;systematic review. Int J Psychiatry Clin Pract. 2020;24(1):3–9. doi: 10.1080/13651501.2019.1676452. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Wied TS, Haberstroh J, Gather J, Karakaya T, Oswald F, Qubad M, Scholten M, Vollmann J, Pantel J. Supported decision-making in persons with dementia: Development of an enhanced consent procedure for lumbar puncture. Front Psychiatry. 2021 doi: 10.3389/fpsyt.2021.780276. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 20. Scholten M, Vollmann J. Patientenselbstbestimmung und Selbstbestimmungsfähigkeit. In: Vollmann J, editor. Ethik in der Psychiatrie: Ein Praxisbuch. Köln: Psychiatrie Verlag; 2017. [ Google Scholar ] 21. Cairns R, Maddock C, Buchanan A, David AS, Hayward P, Richardson G, et al. Reliability of mental capacity assessments in psychiatric in-patients. Br J Psychiatry. 2005;187:372–378. doi: 10.1192/bjp.187.4.372. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 22. Raymont V, Buchanan A, David AS, Hayward P, Wessely S, Hotopf M. The inter-rater reliability of mental capacity assessments. Int J Law Psychiatry. 2007;30(2):112–117. doi: 10.1016/j.ijlp.2005.09.006. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 23. Braun E, Gaillard A‑S, Vollmann J, Gather J, Scholten M. Mental health service users’ perspectives on psychiatric advance directives: a systematic review. Psychiatr Serv. 2022 doi: 10.1176/appi.ps.202200003. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 24. Gaillard A‑S, Braun E, Vollmann J, Gather J, Scholten M. The content of psychiatric advance directives: a systematic review. Psychiatr Serv. 2022 doi: 10.1176/appi.ps.202200002. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 25. Chieze M, Hurst S, Kaiser S, Sentissi O. Effects of seclusion and restraint in adult psychiatry: a&nbsp;systematic review. Front Psychiatry. 2019;10:491. doi: 10.3389/fpsyt.2019.00491. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ]